audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.01.04-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"路上小心。","meaning_my":"လမ်းမှာ သတိထားနော်။","audio_file":"01.01.04-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.01.04-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我先走啦。","meaning_my":"အရင်သွားနှင့်မယ်နော်။","audio_file":"01.01.04-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.01.04-S002","kind":"main","cn":"我先回去了。","meaning_my":"အရင်ပြန်နှင့်တော့မယ်။","audio_file":"01.01.04-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.01.04-S002_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，到家说一声。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ အိမ်ရောက်ရင် ပြောနော်။","audio_file":"01.01.04-S002_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.01.04-S003","kind":"main","cn":"再见。","meaning_my":"နောက်မှတွေ့မယ်။","audio_file":"01.01.04-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.01.04-S004","kind":"main","cn":"明天见。","meaning_my":"မနက်ဖြန်တွေ့မယ်။","audio_file":"01.01.04-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.01.04-S005","kind":"main","cn":"晚安。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းကောင်းအိပ်ပါနော်။","audio_file":"01.01.04-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.01.04-S005_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"晚安，明天见。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းကောင်းအိပ်နော်၊ မနက်ဖြန်တွေ့မယ်။","audio_file":"01.01.04-S005_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.01.04-S006","kind":"main","cn":"到家告诉我。","meaning_my":"အိမ်ရောက်ရင် ပြောနော်။","audio_file":"01.01.04-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.01.04-S006_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"到家了说一声。","meaning_my":"အိမ်ရောက်ရင် ပြောနော်။","audio_file":"01.01.04-S006_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.01.04-S007","kind":"main","cn":"好，到了给你发消息。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ရောက်ရင် စာပို့လိုက်မယ်။","audio_file":"01.01.04-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.01.04-S008","kind":"main","cn":"到家了吗？","meaning_my":"အိမ်ရောက်ပြီလား။","audio_file":"01.01.04-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.01.04-S008_reply01","kind":"reply